JavaScript:
BattleManager.makeEscapeRatio = function() {
    this._escapeRatio = (0.25 * $gameParty.agility()) / $gameTroop.agility();
};
save this as JS and it works.
default is 0.5 and it adds 0.1 on escape failure

the way I did it should work, but it also has it's party and game troop agility
that plays a role so it has a higher change.
JavaScript:
BattleManager.makeEscapeRatio = function() {
    this._escapeRatio = 0.25 ; // always 25% change + 0.1 from failure
};

BattleManager.makeEscapeRatio = function() {
    this._escapeRatio = 0; // fails the first time, 10% afterwards
};
you can always set it not able to as well, but require further modification.
